 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-06-22",
   "text": "Define WOTUS Act of 2021\n This bill describes which bodies of water fall under federal jurisdiction for purposes of the Clean Water Act. Specifically, the bill redefines navigable waters and establishes a process for the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers to determine, upon request, whether certain waters are navigable waters."
  }
